  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w05.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w05.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "二度目の山道は、硫黄の匂いまで懐かしかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "大会明けの温泉行き。今年は静かな旅——のはずだった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "速達は、今年も来た。差出人、闘技場計測室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「貴チームのランク: 最上級(継続)。特記事項: 前年比、異常なし」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……異常なし、とわざわざ書かれると、逆に不安になるのはなぜだろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "更新版の選手証も同封されていた。金縁が、二重になってる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「二年目の線です」とノノさんの添え書き。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "年輪みたいな身分証だ。ちょっと、気に入ってしまった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今年のバスは、去年より席が足りなかった。うちの所帯が、それだけ増えたということだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "通路まで詰まった顔ぶれを見渡して、静かに満足した。定員オーバーは、いい悩みだ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "暖簾の前で、仲居さんが深々と頭を下げた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「お待ちしておりました——今年も」今年も、が嬉しい宿だ。効能書きの隅の字も、今年も健在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「すべての疲れに効く(物忘れにも)」……効き目は、確からしい。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w05.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "宴会は、去年より静かに始まって、去年より大きく育った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今年は誰も「最上級」でははしゃがない。かわりに「連覇」の二文字で、全員がはしゃいだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……成長といえば成長だ。方向はさておき。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "宴の締めに、今年の目標を一言ずつ回した。連覇。契約の解放。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "新しい仲間。最後に私の番が来て、手短に言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「今年も、いい一年にしましょう」湯のせいか、拍手が去年より大きかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.008d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.008d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳が、じんわり熱い。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰りの荷物に、宿の売店の貼り紙が一枚紛れていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「近日、街にてリバイバル公演。演目は名場面の数々!」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w05.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——山の宿まで、あの宣伝が来ている。会社の本気の速さだけは、認めざるを得ない。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.w05.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
    "status": "review",
